.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH quotadial-history 1  "QuotaDial 0.2.0" QuotaDial
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
quotadial\-history \- Show how each window was used over time, from the daemon\*(Aqs history
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquotadial history\fR [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-provider\fR] [\fB\-\-account\fR] [\fB\-\-window\fR] [\fB\-\-csv\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show how each window was used over time, from the daemon\*(Aqs history
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SINCE>\fR [default: 7d]
From how long ago: such as 24h, 7d or 30d, or a time such as 2099\-01\-01T00:00:00Z
.TP
\fB\-\-provider\fR \fI<PROVIDER>\fR
Only this provider: claude, codex, gemini or antigravity, or copilot in a build with it
.TP
\fB\-\-account\fR \fI<ACCOUNT>\fR
Only this account, by its email address or id
.TP
\fB\-\-window\fR \fI<WINDOW>\fR
Only windows with this label, such as Session or Weekly
.TP
\fB\-\-csv\fR
Print every reading as CSV, for a spreadsheet
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON, the same as `GET /v1/history`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SEE ALSO"
quotadial(1). The full guide is docs/CLI.md in QuotaDial\*(Aqs repository, https://github.com/pghmatt/quotadial, and quotadial.com.
